        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-665-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH666-LIVE-INSPECT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH667-STREAM-SYNC-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH668-INSPECT-LAT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
